.TH NN-CANONICALIZE 1 "2026" "nn 0.1.0" "NN Manual"
.SH NAME
nn-canonicalize \- write a stable canonical representation
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nn canonicalize [options] <model>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print a weight-free canonical graph text suitable for hashing and diffing.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 success.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
nn canonicalize model.onnx
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
nn-hash(1), nn-diff(1)
